    "Metal 渲染默认开启,遇到显示异常可在此关闭,切换即时生效。回滚行数对新开的标签页生效。⌘点击可打开终端里的链接;双击选词、三击选行。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Metal rendering is on by default; turn it off here if you see glitches — takes effect immediately. Scrollback lines apply to new tabs. ⌘-click opens links in the terminal; double-click selects a word, triple-click a line."
          }
        }
      }
    },
