    "iOS 端 Termite 扫码即连;手机浏览器扫同一个码走网页版。二维码即访问链接,重新生成密钥后旧码作废。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan with Termite for iOS to connect; a phone browser scanning the same code opens the web client. The QR code is the access link — regenerating the key invalidates old codes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pid %@ · %@": {
